WEBVTT

00:09:30.954 --> 00:09:36.912
You know, I think that the biggest thing
is that I'm OK in this world.

00:09:37.579 --> 00:09:44.621
I have the strength and the courage and
the resilience and the heart to be OK,

00:09:44.621 --> 00:09:50.037
to be safe within myself. And I
think that that's what I mean.

00:09:50.037 --> 00:09:51.871
When I said to be a warrior, I mean,

00:09:51.871 --> 00:09:54.912
I think we are very often think
of this in terms of battle.

00:09:55.121 --> 00:09:58.246
And years ago I wrote I wrote
about this in a while, too.

00:09:58.246 --> 00:10:02.246
But so right after my mom died,
I was living in Minneapolis.